      "short": "$x=3,4,5$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}10(2x-4)&<80\\\\2x-4&<8\\\\2x&<12\\\\x&<6\\end{align*}$$\nThe height must be positive:\n$$\\begin{align*}2x-4&>0\\\\2x&>4\\\\x&>2\\end{align*}$$\nThus $2<x<6$, so the possible whole number values are $x=3,4,5$.",
